y features music from Daft Punk's  album discovery and I just love  rewatching this film and re listening to  that album over and over again they are  both amazing if you still haven't seen  this film be sure to check it out on  Friday PewDiePie who is the biggest  youtuber ever made a video called why am  I so embarrassed in which he talks about  some of his favorite anime but  throughout the video he is really  embarrassed about the fact that he likes  anime PewDiePie seems to have the  impression that liking anime is nerdy  and embarrassing and he actually seems  to feel bad about being an  and you can definitely tell that he is  an anime fan because if you watch the  video you'll see that he's watched a lot  of anime and even read a lot of manga  now for us anime fans it's pretty weird  that someone would be so embarrassed  just for liking anime and Noble aka lost  paws actually made a video about this on  Saturday  responding to PewDiePie and asking the  question of why if PewDiePie has already  done such embarrassing things in his  previous videos is he still so  embarrassed about just liking anime I  think that a lot of this stigma about  being an anime fan comes from that whole  weeaboo meme and the fact that nowadays  everybody who likes anime even a little  bit is likely to be called a weeb or a  weeaboo online and I really I have a lot  to say about this so I think I'm gonna  upload a separate video talking about  this very issue soon probably tomorrow  so look out for that but in the meantime  definitely check out Nobles video  because he talks about some really  important issues and he raises some  excellent points in response to  PewDiePie's video WatchMojo uploaded  another top 10 list this week surprise  surprise  but actually this week they uploaded a  top 10 anime memes list in general I'm  not a huge fan of watch modules anime  lists because they tend to prioritize  those anime that are really popular in  the West at the expense of quality anime  